        "action": "expect",
        "status": "divergent",
        "note": "DIVERGENCE-2: refreshVars() on a failing OPTIONAL group resolves in Node (every failure is warned and swallowed) but returns the error in Go. The ADR only says refreshVars 'mirrors refreshSecrets()' and never states whether a partial failure is observable to the caller.",
        "adr": "docs/cnos-runtime-vars.md - 'Runtime SDK surfaces' (await cnos.refreshVars(); no failure contract)",
        "observed": {
          "node": { "refreshOutcome": "ok" },
          "go": { "refreshOutcome": "error" }
        }
      }
    ]
